@tone notes [color:#334155][bg:#f8fafc]
@width description [width:large]
@height note [height:3]

@sheet Roadmap [columns:fit][rows:wrap]
@header | Status[width:xshort] | Title[width:normal] | Description[width:description] |
[wrap] | ok | Parser | Sheet defaults and aliases are parsed into the workbook AST. |
[wrap][height:note] | yes | Renderer | Fit columns size from visible content, then wrapped rows expand or clamp. |
[ellipsis][height:1] | no | Editor | Compact rows stay clipped when ellipsis is explicit. |
| note[tone:notes] | Alias | Tone, width, and height aliases resolve only in their own namespaces. |
